{"id":"37e6b9b5eadcc91a","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-game4-discounted-payoff.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Discounted Payoff","display":"df-zfc-game4-discounted-payoff — ZFC Game4 Discounted Payoff","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-discounted-payoff","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-discounted-payoff"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-discounted-payoff — ZFC Game4 Discounted Payoff","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-discounted-payoff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-discounted-payoff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-discounted-payoff — ZFC Game4 Discounted Payoff"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8eb5064b65f8a92\" href=\"?note=d8eb5064b65f8a92\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md\">../batch08/58-df-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\delta\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> (discount factor)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec u\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega\">\\(\\vec u\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega\\)</span> (stage-payoff sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(v\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> (normalized discounted payoff)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DiscountedPayoff}\">\\(\\operatorname{DiscountedPayoff}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}discounted\\text{-}payoff} \\vdash \\operatorname{DiscountedPayoff}(\\delta,\\vec u,v)\\leftrightarrow\\delta\\in(0,1)\\land\\vec u\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|\\vec u(n)|\\leq C)\\bigr)\\land v=(1-\\delta)\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\delta^n\\vec u(n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}discounted\\text{-}payoff} \\vdash \\operatorname{DiscountedPayoff}(\\delta,\\vec u,v)\\leftrightarrow\\delta\\in(0,1)\\land\\vec u\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|\\vec u(n)|\\leq C)\\bigr)\\land v=(1-\\delta)\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\delta^n\\vec u(n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The factor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-\\delta\">\\(1-\\delta\\)</span> normalizes the weights to sum to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>. Bounded stage payoffs ensure that the displayed series converges absolutely.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d8eb5064b65f8a92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sequence.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec u\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DiscountedPayoff}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}discounted\\text{-}payoff} \\vdash \\operatorname{DiscountedPayoff}(\\delta,\\vec u,v)\\leftrightarrow\\delta\\in(0,1)\\land\\vec u\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|\\vec u(n)|\\leq C)\\bigr)\\land v=(1-\\delta)\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\delta^n\\vec u(n)","display":true},{"tex":"1-\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false}],"bytes":1097,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-game4-discounted-payoff.md|58-df-zfc-game4-discounted-payoff]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","d8eb5064b65f8a92"]}